        "ReactionResultDesc": {
          "TableId": "/Game/Text/ST_ReactionDes.ST_ReactionDes",
          "Key": "Reaction_guangxiang_des",
          "SourceString": "触发异能环合后的<NumGreen>5</>秒内，目标进入延滞状态，移动及攻击速度降低，并随时间逐渐复原。如频繁进入延滞状态，目标恢复至常态的速度将会加快。",
          "LocalizedString": "The target enters Remora for <NumGreen>5s</> after triggering Esper Cycle, slowing their movement and attack speed. The effect decays over time, and will have a shorter duration if repeatedly applied."
        },
