            "LocalDesc": {
              "TableId": "/Game/Text/PlayerSkillDes/Elyms_SkillDes.Elyms_SkillDes",
              "Key": "GA_Elyms_Passive_1_2",
              "SourceString": "<TextHLT>「延滞」强化</>：队伍中任意角色对目标施加「延滞」时，曳尔沐会在<NumGreen>7.5</>秒后对该目标追加一次「延滞」。该效果每<NumGreen>7</>秒至多触发一次，且通过该效果施加的「延滞」不会再次触发该效果。",
              "LocalizedString": "<TextHLT>Remora Enhancement</>: Causes Elyms to reapply Remora to the same target after <NumGreen>7.5</>s whenever an ally applies Remora. Triggers at most once every <NumGreen>7</>s. Remora applied this way cannot trigger this effect again."
            }
