          "TableId": "/Game/Text/ST_ReactionDes.ST_ReactionDes",
          "Key": "Reaction_guangling",
          "SourceString": "创生",
          "LocalizedString": "Blossom"
        },
        "ReactionResultDesc": {
          "TableId": "/Game/Text/ST_ReactionDes.ST_ReactionDes",
          "Key": "Reaction_guangling_des",
          "SourceString": "触发异能环合后，目标附近将诞生<NumGreen>1</>株<bule>「创生株」</>，并绽放<NumGreen>5</>朵<bule>「创生花」</>。\r\n每隔<NumGreen>2</>秒，<bule>「创生花」</>会陆续飞向射程内的目标并爆炸，造成一定范围伤害。\r\n场上最多同时存在<NumGreen>3</>株<bule>「创生株」</>。",
          "LocalizedString": "Generates <NumGreen>1</> <bule>Vita Bud</> near the target after triggering Esper Cycle, which blossoms <NumGreen>5</> <bule>Vita Pistils</>.\r\n<bule>Vita Pistils</> then fly toward targets within range, exploding every <NumGreen>2s</> and dealing DMG to an area.\r\nUp to <NumGreen>3</> <bule>Vita Buds</> can exist on the field at once."
        },
