            "ReactionAbilityID": "GA_BlackBird_Passive_1",
            "LocalDesc": {
              "TableId": "/Game/Text/PlayerSkillDes/BlackBird_SkillDes.BlackBird_SkillDes",
              "Key": "GA_BlackBird_Passive_1_1",
              "SourceString": "<TextHLT>「黯星」强化</>：「黯星」状态结束时，根据「黯星」期间目标实际受到的累计伤害，黑羽额外对其造成相当于累计伤害<NumGreen>20%</>的心灵伤害（累计伤害不包含触发该次黯星状态的援护技和该次黯星状态自身造成的伤害），最高不超过黑羽基础攻击力的<NumGreen>1000</>倍，且不受其他伤害增减益效果影响。随后，由黑羽为目标施加1次「黯星」。\r\n通过本效果施加的「黯星」无法再次触发施加「黯星」效果。",
              "LocalizedString": "<TextHLT>Nova Enhancement</>: When Nova ends, deals additional Mental DMG equal to <NumGreen>20%</> of the actual total DMG taken by the target while Nova was active (excluding DMG dealt by the Support Skill that triggered Nova and by Nova itself), up to <NumGreen>1,000×</> of Blackbird's Base ATK. This additional DMG is not affected by any other DMG Buffs or Debuffs. Inflicts Nova on the target once afterward.\r\nPrevents Nova inflicted by this effect from triggering the Nova reapplication effect again."
            }
          }
